# model checkpoints (E-F/E-G fusion bases): local artifacts. NOTE (audit
# 2026-07-23 15:59): results JSONs record init_state_sha256 (initial state),
# and runs after 2026-07-23 also record best_ckpt_sha256 (final checkpoint);
# earlier E-F/E-G checkpoints have no recorded final digest -- their
# regeneration boundary is the seed-deterministic training command.
